{
  "title": { "zh": "由假设得证" },
  "adds": ["assumption"],
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "倒着用假设框，目标少一层「若」，却没有证完：<part-ref to=\"part:rule\"></part-ref>只会把目标换成前提。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "新元件<part-ref to=\"part:assumption\"></part-ref>：把第一个目标和它的一条已知合一，对上了，这个目标就证完了。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "r-assumption",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "tests": [{ "goal": "Rain → (Wind → Rain)" }, { "goal": "Wet → (Slip → Wet)" }, { "goal": "¬Rain → (Rain → ¬Rain)" }],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，证完每一个目标。" },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "剥掉所有的「若」之后，剩下的目标在哪里？" }],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = impI()",
        "c1r0 = impI()",
        "c0 = rule(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = rule(c0, c1r0)",
        "c2 = assumption(c1)",
        "out <- c2"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
